# ============================================================================
# 11 Lucid — WBTB Re-entry   *** EXPERIMENTAL [E/P]-tier timing ***
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Goal:     Wake-Back-To-Bed re-entry. Set an alarm for ~4.5-6 h after sleep
#           onset (longest REM is in the last third of night), wake, stay up
#           15-60 min doing reality checks + MILD intention, then lie back down
#           and run this SHORT arc as you return to sleep. Closest analog our
#           device has to "cueing near REM." Deliberately short so you drift
#           back into REM-rich late sleep.
# Duration: 12:00 (720,000 ms). Ends in a SOFT OFF -> drift back to sleep.
# Arc (research Arc B "WBTB Re-entry"):
#   1. Re-settle           00:00-04:00  quick settle alpha 10 -> theta ~6 Hz;
#                                        light 10->6 Hz dim violet, vol+light
#                                        fade IN, brief breathing LFO.
#   2. Theta hold + gamma  04:00-09:00  beat 6->5 Hz, light very dim; low-volume
#                                        40 Hz AUDIO isochronic gamma cue (ch2).
#   3. Soft Off            09:00-12:00  light brightness AND all audio volumes
#                                        fade to 0 together. No wake ramp.
# Bands:    settle alpha 10->6 Hz (fast, already sleep-pressured); theta hold
#           6->5 Hz; lucidity gamma 40 Hz (Voss cue) — AUDIO ONLY.
#
# SAFETY (guidelines section 4): 40 Hz gamma delivered as AUDIO isochronic ONLY
#   (ch2), NEVER as bright strobe (15-25 Hz photosensitive band). All LED flicker
#   <=10 Hz, dim violet only (no saturated red, no red<->blue). Binaural carrier
#   ~200 Hz (<1000), L/R offset = beat <=10 Hz (<35). Brightness ramps IN 0->15%
#   over 15 s (>=15 s), capped <=15%, fades to 0 over the final 3 min (Soft Off,
#   never abrupt). Volume fades IN over 30 s.
#
# *** EXPERIMENTAL: pre-sleep priming, not an in-dream trigger (no REM sensor). ***
#
# LED:   time freq duty bright R G B mask   (mask 15 = all four zones)
# Audio: A time freq pan vol mod ch [freq_r] [wave]   (freq_r fixed => binaural
#        beat = freq_r - carrier; mod = isochronic beat Hz; wave 0=sine)
# Ramp convention = animate-on-start: '>' on the EARLIER entry (value = start);
# target = the next same-channel/field entry. LFO self-contained ~min:max:period.
# ============================================================================

# ---- LED: dim violet, 10->6->5 Hz (1:1 with beat), brief breathing, Soft Off --
0 10 50 >0 90 0 200 15   # t=00:00 10 Hz flicker, brightness fade-in from 0
15000 10 50 15 90 0 200 15   # t=00:15 brightness 15% reached (15 s ramp-in)
30000 >10 50 ~8:15:10000 90 0 200 15   # t=00:30 flicker descent START 10 Hz; breathing LFO 8<->15%
240000 >6 50 >15 90 0 200 15   # t=04:00 beat 6 Hz; end breathing, brightness 15->8 (theta, dim)
540000 5 50 >8 90 0 200 15   # t=09:00 beat 5 Hz; SOFT OFF START: brightness 8 -> 0
720000 5 50 0 90 0 200 15   # t=12:00 fully off (no wake ramp)

# ---- ch1: binaural driver — carrier glide, freq_r FIXED 210 (beat=210-carrier)
A 0      200 0 >0 0 1 210 0               # t=00:00 carrier 200 => 10 Hz beat; vol fade-in from 0
A 30000  >200 0 80 0 1 210 0              # t=00:30 vol 40 reached; carrier glide START 200->204
A 240000 >204 0 80 0 1 210 0              # t=04:00 beat 6 Hz; carrier glides 204->205
A 540000 205 0 >80 0 1 210 0              # t=09:00 beat 5 Hz; SOFT OFF: vol 40 -> 0
A 720000 205 0 0 0 1 210 0                # t=12:00 silent

# ---- ch2: 40 Hz gamma lucidity cue — AUDIO ISOCHRONIC ONLY (Voss), joins theta
A 240000 250 0 >0 40 2                    # t=04:00 carrier 250, isochronic mod 40 Hz; vol fade-in from 0
A 300000 250 0 30 40 2                    # t=05:00 gamma cue steady at low vol 15
A 540000 250 0 >30 40 2                   # t=09:00 SOFT OFF: gamma vol 15 -> 0
A 720000 250 0 0 40 2                     # t=12:00 silent

# ---- Speech markers (sparse, calm, at phase transitions) ----------------------
S 3000 default 20 "Back to bed. Let the waking mind settle, and sink quickly toward theta."
S 240000 default 20 "Theta now, the dream gateway. Hold your intention: I will know when I am dreaming."
S 360000 default 20 "Let the body sleep while a thread of awareness stays. Watch the images come."
S 540000 default 20 "Let go now, and dream aware."

# Soft Off: 09:00-12:00 LED brightness and ALL audio volumes ramp to 0 together.
# Short by design — the user drifts back into REM-rich late sleep, primed.
